  <developer id="xyz.joshuahirsig">
    <name>Joshua Hirsig</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      Etiketto is a label designer for the Brother VC-500W colour label printer,
      which prints on ZINK paper. It brings the workflow of Brother's own editor,
      only available for Windows, macOS and phones, to the Linux desktop.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Detects the inserted cassette (9 to 50 mm) and the remaining tape</li>
      <li>Automatic length that grows with the content, or a fixed length</li>
      <li>Text in any installed font, images and photos, QR codes and barcodes</li>
      <li>Background colours and images printed edge to edge, borders</li>
      <li>Vivid colour mode and full, half or no cut, over the network</li>
      <li>Live preview at print resolution, templates, PNG export</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Etiketto is not affiliated with Brother Industries. Brother and VC-500W are
      trademarks of their owners; ZINK is a trademark of ZINK Holdings LLC.
    </p>
  </description>

